# 基础词 Unit09
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit09核心词汇

{{gain}}{{/ɡeɪn}}{{v./n. 获得；增加；收益}}{{She gained valuable experience from the internship.}}
{{gallery}}{{/ˈɡæləri}}{{n. 画廊；美术馆}}{{The art gallery displays works by local artists.}}
{{gap}}{{/ɡæp}}{{n. 缺口；差距；间隔}}{{There is a significant gap between the rich and the poor.}}
{{gather}}{{/ˈɡæðər}}{{v. 聚集；收集；推断}}{{People gathered in the square to celebrate the festival.}}
{{gender}}{{/ˈdʒendər}}{{n. 性别}}{{Gender equality is an important social issue.}}
{{gene}}{{/dʒiːn}}{{n. 基因}}{{Genes play a key role in determining physical traits.}}
{{general}}{{/ˈdʒenrəl}}{{adj./n. 一般的；将军}}{{The general opinion is that the plan is workable.}}
{{generate}}{{/ˈdʒenəreɪt}}{{v. 产生；引起}}{{The wind turbines generate electricity for the town.}}
{{generation}}{{/ˌdʒenəˈreɪʃn}}{{n. 一代人；产生}}{{The younger generation is more open to new ideas.}}
{{generous}}{{/ˈdʒenərəs}}{{adj. 慷慨的；大方的}}{{She is generous with her time and money.}}
{{genius}}{{/ˈdʒiːniəs}}{{n. 天才；天赋}}{{Einstein was a genius in physics.}}
{{gentle}}{{/ˈdʒentl}}{{adj. 温柔的；温和的}}{{She has a gentle voice that calms everyone.}}
{{genuine}}{{/ˈdʒenjuɪn}}{{adj. 真正的；真诚的}}{{The painting is a genuine masterpiece.}}
{{gesture}}{{/ˈdʒestʃər}}{{n./v. 手势；姿态}}{{He made a gesture of welcome with his hand.}}
{{global}}{{/ˈɡləʊbl}}{{adj. 全球的；全面的}}{{Global warming is a major environmental concern.}}
{{glory}}{{/ˈɡlɔːri}}{{n. 光荣；荣耀}}{{The athletes brought glory to their country.}}
{{goal}}{{/ɡəʊl}}{{n. 目标；进球}}{{Her goal is to become a successful writer.}}
{{golden}}{{/ˈɡəʊldən}}{{adj. 金色的；黄金般的}}{{This is a golden opportunity for young entrepreneurs.}}
{{goods}}{{/ɡʊdz}}{{n. 商品；货物}}{{The store sells a variety of household goods.}}
{{govern}}{{/ˈɡʌvn}}{{v. 统治；管理；支配}}{{The country is governed by a democratic system.}}
{{grace}}{{/ɡreɪs}}{{n. 优雅；恩惠}}{{She moved with grace and elegance.}}
{{gradual}}{{/ˈɡrædʒuəl}}{{adj. 逐渐的；渐进的}}{{There has been a gradual improvement in his health.}}
{{graduate}}{{/ˈɡrædʒueɪt}}{{v./n. 毕业；毕业生}}{{She graduated from university with honors.}}
{{grant}}{{/ɡrɑːnt}}{{v./n. 授予；拨款；助学金}}{{The government granted permission for the construction.}}
{{grasp}}{{/ɡrɑːsp}}{{v./n. 抓住；理解；掌握}}{{He quickly grasped the main idea of the article.}}
{{grateful}}{{/ˈɡreɪtfl}}{{adj. 感激的；感谢的}}{{I am grateful for your generous help.}}
{{grave}}{{/ɡreɪv}}{{adj./n. 严重的；坟墓}}{{The patient is in a grave condition.}}
{{gravity}}{{/ˈɡrævəti}}{{n. 重力；严重性}}{{Gravity keeps us firmly on the ground.}}
{{greedy}}{{/ˈɡriːdi}}{{adj. 贪婪的；贪吃的}}{{The greedy businessman wanted more and more profit.}}
{{greet}}{{/ɡriːt}}{{v. 问候；迎接}}{{She greeted the guests at the door.}}
{{grief}}{{/ɡriːf}}{{n. 悲伤；痛苦}}{{She was overcome with grief after the loss.}}
{{grind}}{{/ɡraɪnd}}{{v. 磨碎；折磨}}{{The old mill was used to grind wheat into flour.}}
{{grip}}{{/ɡrɪp}}{{v./n. 紧握；控制}}{{He gripped the rope tightly to avoid falling.}}
{{gross}}{{/ɡrəʊs}}{{adj./n. 总的；严重的；毛额}}{{The gross profit of the company increased by 15%.}}
{{guarantee}}{{/ˌɡærənˈtiː}}{{v./n. 保证；担保}}{{The product comes with a two-year guarantee.}}
{{guard}}{{/ɡɑːd}}{{n./v. 守卫；保护}}{{The guard stood at the entrance of the building.}}
{{guess}}{{/ɡes}}{{v./n. 猜测；推测}}{{Can you guess how old she is?}}
{{guide}}{{/ɡaɪd}}{{n./v. 导游；指导}}{{The guide led us through the ancient temple.}}
{{guilty}}{{/ˈɡɪlti}}{{adj. 有罪的；内疚的}}{{He was found guilty of theft.}}
{{gulf}}{{/ɡʌlf}}{{n. 海湾；鸿沟}}{{The Gulf of Mexico is known for its oil reserves.}}
{{habit}}{{/ˈhæbɪt}}{{n. 习惯；习性}}{{Reading before bed is a good habit.}}
{{halt}}{{/hɔːlt}}{{v./n. 停止；暂停}}{{The train came to a halt at the station.}}
{{handle}}{{/ˈhændl}}{{v./n. 处理；把手}}{{She handles pressure very well.}}
{{handsome}}{{/ˈhænsəm}}{{adj. 英俊的；可观的}}{{He is a tall and handsome young man.}}
{{hang}}{{/hæŋ}}{{v. 悬挂；绞死}}{{She hung the picture on the wall.}}
{{harbor}}{{/ˈhɑːbər}}{{n./v. 港口；怀有}}{{The ship arrived at the harbor early in the morning.}}
{{hardship}}{{/ˈhɑːdʃɪp}}{{n. 艰难；困苦}}{{They endured many hardships during the war.}}
{{harm}}{{/hɑːm}}{{n./v. 伤害；损害}}{{Smoking does great harm to your health.}}
{{harmony}}{{/ˈhɑːməni}}{{n. 和谐；协调}}{{The community lives in harmony with nature.}}
{{harvest}}{{/ˈhɑːvɪst}}{{n./v. 收获；收割}}{{The farmers celebrated a good harvest this year.}}
{{haste}}{{/heɪst}}{{n. 匆忙；急忙}}{{In her haste, she forgot to lock the door.}}
{{hatred}}{{/ˈheɪtrɪd}}{{n. 憎恨；仇恨}}{{Hatred only breeds more hatred.}}
{{headline}}{{/ˈhedlaɪn}}{{n. 标题；头条新闻}}{{The headline of the newspaper caught my attention.}}
{{heal}}{{/hiːl}}{{v. 治愈；痊愈}}{{The wound took a long time to heal.}}
{{heap}}{{/hiːp}}{{n./v. 堆；大量}}{{There was a heap of clothes on the floor.}}
{{hesitate}}{{/ˈhezɪteɪt}}{{v. 犹豫；踌躇}}{{Don't hesitate to ask if you need help.}}
{{highlight}}{{/ˈhaɪlaɪt}}{{v./n. 强调；亮点}}{{The report highlights the importance of education.}}
{{hint}}{{/hɪnt}}{{n./v. 暗示；提示}}{{She gave me a hint about the answer.}}
{{honor}}{{/ˈɒnər}}{{n./v. 荣誉；尊敬}}{{It is an honor to receive this award.}}
{{horizon}}{{/həˈraɪzn}}{{n. 地平线；视野}}{{The sun disappeared below the horizon.}}
{{horrible}}{{/ˈhɒrəbl}}{{adj. 可怕的；糟糕的}}{{The accident was a horrible experience for everyone.}}
{{host}}{{/həʊst}}{{n./v. 主人；主持；招待}}{{She hosted a dinner party for her friends.}}
{{household}}{{/ˈhaʊshəʊld}}{{n./adj. 家庭；家用的}}{{Household expenses have increased this year.}}
{{humble}}{{/ˈhʌmbl}}{{adj. 谦虚的；卑微的}}{{Despite his success, he remains humble.}}
{{humor}}{{/ˈhjuːmər}}{{n. 幽默；心情}}{{He has a great sense of humor.}}
{{hunt}}{{/hʌnt}}{{v./n. 打猎；搜索}}{{They went out to hunt for deer in the forest.}}
{{hurry}}{{/ˈhʌri}}{{v./n. 赶紧；匆忙}}{{Hurry up, or we'll miss the bus!}}
{{hurt}}{{/hɜːt}}{{v./n. 伤害；疼痛}}{{His words hurt her feelings deeply.}}
